<import src="../../templates/header.wxml" />
<view class="page">
  <template is="header" data="{{xp}}" />
  <view class="title">错题本</view><view class="muted">集中复习拼错、提示和跳过的题目，逐步巩固记忆。</view>
  <view class="card surface-card review-toolbar"><view class="row"><view><view class="eyebrow">待复习</view><view class="review-count">{{items.length}}<text> 道题</text></view></view><button class="primary" disabled="{{!items.length}}" bindtap="start">开始复习（{{items.length}}）</button></view></view>
  <view class="card review-card" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="key"><view class="row review-top"><view class="review-english">{{item.english}}</view><text class="pending">待复习</text></view><view class="review-meaning">{{item.zh}}</view><view class="muted review-source">{{item.label}}</view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="card surface-card empty"><view class="empty-symbol">✓</view><view class="section-title">暂时没有错题</view><view class="muted">练习中的难点会自动收录在这里。<view>继续练习，让每一次进步都有迹可循。</view></view><button class="secondary gap" bindtap="learn">去练习 →</button></view>
  <view class="storage-note">复习时独立答对，即可移出错题本</view>
</view>
